# makepkg build output. The playbook copies the PKGBUILD to
# ~/.cache/gatherd/<pkg> and builds there, but building in place is the obvious
# thing to try by hand -- and it drops an 8MB source tarball plus a root-mode
# pkg/ tree next to the PKGBUILD. Untracked and unignored, that is one
# `git add -A` away from being committed.
src/
pkg/
*.pkg.tar.*
*.tar.gz
*.tar.xz
